C03: a request closed by the known-unsupported contract keeps its kind (LIMITS1703)

In LIMITS1701 the literal «Puedes ver tu propio código y analizar si hay alguna falla.» was decided «unsupported» by the known-unsupported contract, but apply_non_effect_conversation_classification re-read it as narration (a finite verb after the head) and relabelled it «followup» with the observation_ack shape; the model answered it as a statement, inventing its own nature, and the veto left the turn to recover by asking. The classification now keeps the unsupported kind when the contract closed the request; true narrations («El viaje del sábado fue muy tranquilo») still become follow-ups.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


